@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
class WorkflowEngine {
  +run(question, doc_id, mode)
  +cancel(task_id)
  -actor
  -reviewer
  -gateway
}
class EventBus {
  +subscribe(...)
  +publish(...)
  -_dispatch(...)
}
class EvidenceGate {
  +validate(answer, ...)
}
class MemoryStore {
  +snapshot(doc_id)
  +add(...)
  +freeze()
}
class GuardedGateway {
  +call(name, arguments)
  +list_tools()
}
class LocalGateway {
  +call(name, arguments)
}
class MCPGateway {
  +call(name, arguments)
}
WorkflowEngine --> EventBus
WorkflowEngine --> EvidenceGate
WorkflowEngine --> MemoryStore
WorkflowEngine --> GuardedGateway
EvidenceGate --> GuardedGateway
GuardedGateway --> LocalGateway : compatible interface
GuardedGateway --> MCPGateway : compatible interface
note bottom of LocalGateway : baseline invokes LocalGateway directly
via a counting wrapper, without GuardedGateway
@enduml
